.\" -*- mode: troff; coding: utf-8 -*-
.TH "btoprs" "1" "2026-08-19" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.LP
btoprs - Rust port of the btop resource monitor.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.LP
\fBbtoprs\fR [\fB-c\fR \fIfile\fR] [\fB-d\fR] [\fB-f\fR \fIfilter\fR] [\fB-l\fR] [\fB-p\fR \fIid\fR] [\fB-t\fR] [\fB-u\fR \fIms\fR] [\fB--force-utf\fR] [\fB--themes-dir\fR \fIdir\fR]
.PP
\fBbtoprs\fR [\fB--default-config\fR | {\fB-h\fR | \fB--help\fR} | {\fB-V\fR | \fB--version\fR}]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.LP
\fBbtoprs\fR shows usage and statistics for processors, GPUs, memory, disks, network interfaces, and processes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP 3
\fB-c\fR, \fB--config \f(BIfile\fB\fR
Path to a config file.
.TP 3
\fB-d\fR, \fB--debug\fR
Start in debug mode with additional logs and metrics.
.TP 3
\fB-f\fR, \fB--filter \f(BIfilter\fB\fR
Set an initial process filter.
.TP 3
\fB--force-utf\fR
Force start even if no UTF-8 locale was detected.
.TP 3
\fB-l\fR, \fB--low-color\fR
Disable true color, 256 colors only.
.TP 3
\fB-p\fR, \fB--preset \f(BIid\fB\fR
Start with a preset (0-9).
.TP 3
\fB-t\fR, \fB--tty\fR
Force tty mode with ANSI graph symbols and 16 colors only.
.TP 3
\fB--no-tty\fR
Force disable tty mode.
.TP 3
\fB--themes-dir \f(BIdir\fB\fR
Path to a custom themes directory.
.TP 3
\fB-u\fR, \fB--update \f(BIms\fB\fR
Set an initial update rate in milliseconds.
.TP 3
\fB--default-config\fR
Print the default config to standard output.
.TP 3
\fB-h\fR, \fB--help\fR
Show summary of options.
.TP 3
\fB-V\fR, \fB--version\fR
Show version information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.LP
\fBbtop\fR(1), \fBtop\fR(1), \fBhtop\fR(1)
